<title>UK: EIB adds 200 million Ffr to 10-year step-up bond.</title>
<headline>EIB adds 200 million Ffr to 10-year step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 1.20 billion French francs from 1.0 billion French francs, lead manager Societe Generale said.</p>
<p>There is a new issue and reoffer price of 99.76.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.20 BLN FFR  COUPON   **5.105     MATURITY  **13.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-UP	 ISS PRICE  99.76     PAY DATE    13.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.325     REOFFER    99.76     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 100-1M    LISTING    PAR/LUX   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES    **STEPS UP TO 6.70 PCT 13.JUN.02 IF NOT CALL AT PAR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
